@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FB
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #355777
skinparam ActorBorderColor #355777
skinparam ArrowColor #355777
hide footbox
autonumber
title Standalone Ollama review-sentence generation

' Sources relative to repository root:
' backend/app/llm/ollama_review.py

actor Operator
participant "Ollama review CLI / adapter" as CLI
participant Ollama
Operator -> CLI : python -m app.llm.ollama_review\n--word ... --meaning ... --model ... [--url ... --timeout ...]
CLI -> CLI : Validate nonblank inputs and positive finite timeout
break Invalid input
  CLI --> Operator : Error on stderr; exit 1
end
CLI -> Ollama : POST /api/generate\nModel, instructions, word + meaning; stream=false; JSON format
alt HTTP / transport / malformed response error
  Ollama --> CLI : Error or invalid envelope
  CLI --> Operator : ReviewError; stderr; exit 1
else Response received
  Ollama --> CLI : done=true; response containing JSON sentence
  CLI -> CLI : Validate nonempty sentence; normalize Unicode\nRequire target exactly once at word boundaries; reject existing blank
  alt Validation fails
    CLI --> Operator : ReviewError(category=invalid_response); exit 1
  else Sentence valid
    CLI -> CLI : Mask target locally
    CLI --> Operator : JSON prompt_sentence + answer; exit 0
  end
end
note over CLI : Standalone utility. Current application prompt jobs use OpenRouter.\nOllama /api/embed is used separately for semantic topic search.
@enduml
